  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_042b713e-a3d3-4661-8b71-4fb868c61220.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"720\"></p><h2>精髓模組</h2><p>在自訂的結構中，與全新的史詩戰鬥生物共同體驗史詩級戰鬥。</p><p>這些生物主要為中後期遊戲設計。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>新增生物</strong></h2><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1552063/description_fc528c44-ade5-4a6b-bc99-6e6a13209dd0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"729\" height=\"707\"></p>\n<h3>[啟蒙者]</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>一個高度機動的Boss，手持獄髓戰鬥法杖。</li>\n<li>擊敗他可獲得獄髓戰鬥法杖</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>你可以透過使用「啟蒙之喚」在「啟蒙沼澤」中找到啟蒙者。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>[「啟蒙之喚」合成配方]</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_cbdb9076-a89c-4ebd-b1db-87572d6bf35d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"499\" height=\"206\"></p>\n<p>滑鼠右鍵使用，它將幫助你找到「啟蒙沼澤」。</p>\n<p>此物品也用於召喚「啟蒙者」。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><em>（若你靠近特定方塊，手持此物品並右鍵點擊，同時凝視著它，或許會發生神秘之事……）</em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>[啟蒙沼澤]</h3>\n<p>「一座充滿啟蒙之力的沼澤」</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1552063/description_21d34c00-ebc2-4f46-b9f4-8a6b9b4e5dfe.png\"></p>\n<p>此結構罕見地生成於沼澤生態域（通常距離重生點 1,000 至 8,000 個方塊）。</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>未來更新將陸續加入更多生物。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1>依賴模組</h1><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h2><strong>- 必備</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod/preview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a>（最新版本）、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-weapons-of-miracles-expansion-wom-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight: Weapons of Miracles Expansion (wom plus)</a>（最新版本）</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-nightfall/preview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EpicFight-Nightfall</a>（最新版本）、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-dawn-day/preview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight: Dawn Day</a>（最新版本）</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-extra/preview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EpicFight-Extra</a>（最新版本）、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relda-mod/preview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reldas Medieval Armor</a>（最新版本）</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-extra/preview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weapons of Miracles - epic fight</a>（最新版本）、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/combat-evolution/preview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Combat Evolution</a>（最新版本）</div><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h2><strong>- 可選</strong></h2>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/p1nero-better-structure-block/preview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">P1nero's Better Structure Block</a>（最新版本）</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>音樂來源</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>\n<h4><strong>Brave Soul [Epic Orchestral Battle Music]</strong></h4>\n</div>\n<div>by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsoundcloud.com%252fmakai-symphony\" rel=\"nofollow\">Makai Symphony</a><br>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsoundcloud.com%252fmakai-symphony%252fbrave-soul-epic-battle-music\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://soundcloud.com/makai-symphony/brave-soul-epic-battle-music</a></p>\n<div>\n<h4><strong>Duel [Epic Orchestral Battle Music]</strong></h4>\n</div>\n<div>by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsoundcloud.com%252fmakai-symphony\" rel=\"nofollow\">Makai Symphony</a><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsoundcloud.com%252fmakai-symphony%252fduel-epic-orchestral-battle-music-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://soundcloud.com/makai-symphony/duel-epic-orchestral-battle-music-1</a></div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h4><strong>Infinity Power [Epic Orchestral Battle Music]</strong></h4>\n<div>by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsoundcloud.com%252fmakai-symphony\" rel=\"nofollow\">Makai Symphony</a><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsoundcloud.com%252fmakai-symphony%252finfinity-power-epic-orchestral-battle-music\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://soundcloud.com/makai-symphony/infinity-power-epic-orchestral-battle-music</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div><h2><strong>備註</strong></h2><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>這是我製作的第一個模組，部分程式碼藉助 AI 協助開發。若發現任何錯誤，歡迎留言回報！</p>\n</div>",
